sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as Render Orch.
  participant O as OpenShorts
  participant B as Blob
  participant Y as YouTube API
  participant M as Meta Graph
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  R->>O: POST /api/render<br/>Idempotency-Key
  loop backoff, max 20 min
    R->>O: GET job status
  end
  O->>B: write MP4
  R->>DB: sha256, QA = PASS
  par YouTube Shorts
    R->>DB: attempt = STARTED
    R->>Y: videos.insert<br/>(resumable)
    Y-->>R: video_id
    R->>DB: YT = LIVE
  and Instagram Reels
    R->>M: POST /media<br/>REELS, resumable
    M-->>R: container_id
    R->>DB: save container_id
    R->>M: upload bytes (rupload)
    loop until FINISHED
      R->>M: GET status_code
    end
    R->>M: POST /media_publish
    M-->>R: ig_media_id
    R->>DB: IG = LIVE
  end
  R->>DB: run summary + audit
